Sources
-------

Each source used to build a released asset is listed here with its licence and
credit line. Input data is downloaded from the source's official page into the
gitignored data/ folder and is not distributed with this repository.
sources.json pins every download by MD5 (from the record) and SHA-256.

TotalSegmentator dataset, small subset, v2.0.1
  Jakob Wasserthal. Zenodo, 2023. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10047263
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
  File: Totalsegmentator_dataset_small_v201.zip
  SHA-256: 6c47636d9727cd97048616383365dd5a588d0bbc5723b5eb0fa736ed08480ffc
  Used: cases s1086 (organ demo), s0903 (male reference body) and s0859
  (female reference body): CT and reference segmentations
  Please also cite: Wasserthal J. et al. TotalSegmentator: Robust Segmentation
  of 104 Anatomic Structures in CT Images. Radiology: Artificial Intelligence,
  2023. https://doi.org/10.1148/ryai.230024

TotalSegmentator dataset v2.0.1 (full)
  Jakob Wasserthal. Zenodo, 2023. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10047292
  Licence: CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
  File: Totalsegmentator_dataset_v201.zip
  SHA-256: 741dbc911a768e2ac2671c66d55332f7302ad624c915a57d08b142d8bdf0ca26
  Downloaded and checked for later cases; no released asset uses it yet.

ANNY body model
  ANNY, a free-to-use 3D human parametric model for all ages. NAVER LABS
  Europe / NAVER Corporation. https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.03589
  Licence: Apache-2.0 code over CC0-1.0 shape assets derived from MakeHuman.
  Baked by scripts/bake_anny.py into the synthetic reference bodies; no scan of
  any person is used. ANNY's non-commercial SMPL/SMPL-X conversion data is
  never downloaded or used.

